<description>&lt;p&gt;The military court has sentenced 66 soldiers to death for cowardice and mutiny after they fled fighting FRN rebels, while ISIS-linked militants killed 33 people and caused patients to flee a hospital, raising Ebola concerns as cases exceed 11,000. Allied Democratic Forces militants attacked Cantine in North Kivu, adding to instability in the eastern region. The WHO warned that cholera has killed 1,800 people in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. An L-410 aircraft crashed while attempting an emergency landing, killing 17 people. Battle-related deaths totaled 1,158 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5hWENNVUc2eUc4ajBIQlZ4aUF5RnF2TnJCVlFCY0RrNkhZbTBweGRlemxnbEY0ZTk0bl9CcnpFRTU2ZmdKSExyNzRMdnNnZlIzRjFoQ0dEMDV1YVlSV1HSAWNBVV95cUxQS1JVQ0YwOWdKbUs4QTlUWWFoSjZUbEhyRndCa1pvWnJPYW5KTHpoV0xqZnlwV3V6NkVnRHp4TzFJemFTcEpaYkxXNk9pVzFWaTZ0U2loXzBwMnFvYmNyamZzMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5wenV4UGRtcTg3SFF4a0pKSk4xb1J0MTRkNGU4N2R3U0Jnaktrd3lkZE1NNHpDMFBrU1RzWVYzSkd1NEZoS1NDOTRsaUo4ak5FS3V6Tzl1WnFtMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOaTduVG1BQVVYSS1HWEs2dGFDaWFXbjdPMjRCZG11YmJLR1BPcEFWSk5Kd0pNV2kybFJVTGNQdGRSZXpqRGRwVGVWeXphN0lidVpONmstWVdQOU5XT0lpM0JMVG5oWGFHWG9ZTENIN3U2QVlWWjhoZkR1ZzlQbjU5R1BHQlpzTmVBSXpIMXM1aEVXZ01SRmdCNGRadE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Morning Star | The People’s Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQeDB4cUpDOHBLXzk3UkU1azNDWEh1VnNDeEF0dTlrQnVZQmVTTkd5WldrR3g2cUMwZXQ4NnVwbGVETVJlZ1VIMTgtbTVxUXZPVXNQNlFQR0dDYkY4RnJzcDVITEctOTU5